{t: Mockingbird}
{st: Based on "Hush Little Baby" performed by Inez and Charlie Foxx, 1963; }
{st: redone by Carly Simon and James Taylor, 1974}
{define: C#dim7 frets 3 4 3 4}

Introduction: the group echoes each syllable with a "Yeah."

[G] Mock (Yeah)
-ing (Yeah)
Bird (Yeah)
Yeah! (Yeah!)
[D7] Mockin'bird, [C#dim7] now

[G] Everybody have you heard
